  "music": {
    "_concept": "ONE melody = the world; every creature 'hears' it through its own eye. The eye motif (sonic logo 5→1→2→3 + answer) is replayed per section in that creature's SCALE and TIMBRE, and the pad's NUMBER OF NOTES = number of colour channels: human triad (3), bee triad shifted up into lydian sparkle (3, UV = 'above us'), dog open fifth with no third (2), snake one low warm drone (heat), bat: no harmony — the CLICKS are the beat and they accelerate into a feeding buzz, mantis shrimp: a 12-note chromatic cluster that COLLAPSES to a bare octave on the twist ('12 receptors, poor discrimination'). Drop = all timbres at once in D lydian; Nagel = near silence, one sonar ping + human triad; sonic logo at drop and loop seam.",
